/**
 * ============================================================================
 *  DEMO DATA — NOT OFFICIAL STATISTICS
 * ============================================================================
 *  Synthetic incident records generated by a seeded pseudo-random generator so
 *  the prototype's KPIs, charts, map and table respond realistically to
 *  filters. They do not describe real events or people and must never be
 *  cited. Records contain no names, addresses or other personal data.
 *
 *  `TEMPLATE_RECORDS` are hand-written examples; the rest of the dataset is
 *  generated around them. Replace `DEMO_INCIDENTS` to connect a real dataset.
 * ============================================================================
 */
